{"3822530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Camp Wombo", "steam_appid": 3822530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/d19b4955ad4fbc08519d8c8ea4c5e9fd.poster.avif?t=1783977885\" width=1170 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/d19b4955ad4fbc08519d8c8ea4c5e9fd.webm?t=1783977885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/d19b4955ad4fbc08519d8c8ea4c5e9fd.mp4?t=1783977885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Stranded. Hunted. Not Alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four friends head into the woods for a fun camping trip</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after their vehicle is stripped for parts overnight, they're left with nothing but fear and a flickering flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/456a24345056888997f810b5bf450b72.poster.avif?t=1783977885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/456a24345056888997f810b5bf450b72.webm?t=1783977885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/456a24345056888997f810b5bf450b72.mp4?t=1783977885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest isn’t empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night brings new horrors twisted traps, shifting shadows, and creatures that hunt without warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/ba667c74f741058d2120bc0e176719cc.poster.avif?t=1783977885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/ba667c74f741058d2120bc0e176719cc.webm?t=1783977885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/ba667c74f741058d2120bc0e176719cc.mp4?t=1783977885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mailbox in the middle of the woods? A couch nailed to a tree? The forest is full of strange sights and stranger threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/0e4270dd7456909db35fdedf670f2621.poster.avif?t=1783977885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/0e4270dd7456909db35fdedf670f2621.webm?t=1783977885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/0e4270dd7456909db35fdedf670f2621.mp4?t=1783977885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some things defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal encounters will test your sanity. Some will make you laugh. Others... you’ll wish you never saw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/c0d1dac4044f778dd75bd0cdac00aa0d.poster.avif?t=1783977885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/c0d1dac4044f778dd75bd0cdac00aa0d.webm?t=1783977885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/extras/c0d1dac4044f778dd75bd0cdac00aa0d.mp4?t=1783977885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even rewards can be a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That treasure chest? It might bite back. Every decision carries risk. Greed could be your undoing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong> is Never Simple</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for <strong>food</strong>, search for <strong>water</strong>, and locate missing <strong>vehicle parts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your hunger, thirst, and mental state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together or fall apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 Player Online Co-op</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic map</strong> that changes every playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events, shifting weather, and unscripted chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two games are ever the same</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape… or Endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find the parts and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you simply try to last one more night?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822530/e